  "translation": "Gomme Eliya, Motishbite, wa ba ba dulago go Giligada, a bolela go Ahabe: Go phela Yahwe, Elohim wa Yisraele, yo ka pele ga gagwe ke emego ⟨mo⟩, ga go tla ba le megokgo goba pula mengwageng ye, ntle le ka lentšu la ka.",
